### ============================================================
### PHASE 32 — AUTH NEGATIVE TESTS
### ============================================================

### 1. Missing API Key → expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Invalid API Key → expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{invalidKey}}

###

### 3. Health check bypasses auth → expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/health

###

### 4. Metrics bypass auth → expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/metrics

###

### ============================================================
### PHASE 25–28 — CORE AGENT LIFECYCLE
### ============================================================

### 5. Create Session
# @name createSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### 6. Run Agent Synchronously — basic goal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "What is 2 + 2?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 3
}

###

### 7. Run Agent Async — GitHub tool use
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run-async
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Analyze the arcclaw repository on github and tell me what it does",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 5
}

###

### 8. Check Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### 9. Terminate Session → expect 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### 10. Non-existent session → expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/fake-id-does-not-exist/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### 11. Invalid request body → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/test-id/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": null,
    "agentRole": "",
    "maxIterations": null
}

###

