### ============================================================
### PHASE 29 — MEMORY PRUNING (N=20 rolling window)
### Send 22 sequential messages — first 2 should be pruned
### Check logs for: [MemoryPruning] pruned N messages
### ============================================================

### 24. Create session for memory test
# @name memorySession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### 25–46. Send 22 sequential messages (duplicate and number them)
### Run requests 25 through 46 — each is message N in sequence
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{memorySession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Memory test message 1 — what is Java?",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### (Repeat above 21 more times changing message number each time)
### After message 21, check logs for pruning activity

